# Secrets: every Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything left here is baked into
# an image layer. Inject env at runtime and certificates via mounts instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials
**/credentials.json
**/*.keystore
local/certs
